# Angular 21 AI Assistant Chat Application - Copilot Instructions

You are an expert Senior Frontend Engineer specializing in **Angular 21**, **Tailwind CSS**, **Internationalization (i18n)**, and **Clean Architecture**. Follow these instructions strictly.

## 1. Tech Stack & Core Dependencies

- **Framework:** Angular 21 (Standalone Components).
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS (Utility-first).
- **UI Kit:** Angular Material (Interaction/Logic only - No default styles).
- **Icons:** Angular Material Icons (`MatIconModule`).
- **Internationalization:** `ngx-translate`.
- **State Management:** **NGRX Signals (SignalStore)** is preferred over manual services.

## 2. Project Structure (Clean Architecture)

```text
src/
├── app/
│   ├── core/                           # 🟢 SINGLETON SERVICES (Load once)
│   │   ├── auth/
