### Component Location Rules

| Component Type       | Location                              | Reusable? |
| :------------------- | :------------------------------------ | :-------- |
| **Shared UI**        | `src/app/shared/components/`          | ✅ Yes    |
| **Feature-specific** | `src/app/features/[name]/components/` | ❌ No     |
| **Page**             | `src/app/features/[name]/pages/`      | ❌ No     |

## 3. Import Paths & Aliases (MANDATORY)

**STRICT RULE:** NEVER use relative paths like `../../../`. ALWAYS use TypeScript aliases.

| Alias Prefix  | Target Directory     |
| :------------ | :------------------- |
| `@core/*`     | `src/app/core/*`     |
| `@shared/*`   | `src/app/shared/*`   |
| `@features/*` | `src/app/features/*` |
| `@types/*`    | `src/types/*`        |
| `@env/*`      | `src/environments/*` |

## 4. File Separation & Naming

- **Separate Files (MANDATORY):** NEVER use inline templates.
- **Pattern:** `name.component.ts`, `name.component.html`, `name.component.scss`.

## 5. Angular 21 Modern Syntax Rules (CRITICAL)

- **Change Detection:** ALWAYS set `changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush`.
- **Inputs/Outputs:** Use `input.required<T>()`, `output<T>()`, `model<T>()`.
- **Computed:** Use `computed()` for derived state.
- **Dependency Injection:** ALWAYS use `inject()` function (No constructor injection).
- **Control Flow:** ALWAYS use `@if`, `@for`, `@switch`, `@defer`.
- **RxJS Interop:** Avoid `.subscribe()` in components. Use `toSignal()` or `AsyncPipe` if absolutely necessary.
- **Host Binding:** Use `host: { class: '...' }` in component metadata instead of `@HostBinding`.

## 6. Styling & Layout (Tailwind CSS)

- **Utility-First:** Write classes directly in `.html`.
- **Responsive:** Use `md:`, `lg:` prefixes.
- **No Magic Numbers:** Use Tailwind spacing (e.g., `p-4`, `gap-2`).

## 7. Internationalization (i18n) Rules

- **NO Hardcoded Text:** NEVER write raw text in `.html`.
- **Use Pipes:** `{{ 'HOME.TITLE' | translate }}`.

## 8. State Management (SignalStore)

- Use `patchState` for updates.
- Encapsulate logic using `withMethods`.
- Expose data using `withComputed`.

## 9. Code Examples

### Example: Feature Component (`src/app/features/chat/components/chat-message/chat-message.component.ts`)

```typescript
import { Component, input, output, computed, ChangeDetectionStrategy, inject } from '@angular/core';
import { CommonModule } from '@angular/common';
import { TranslateModule } from '@ngx-translate/core';
import { MatIconModule } from '@angular/material/icon';
import { Message } from '@types/message.types';

@Component({
  selector: 'app-chat-message',
  standalone: true,
  imports: [CommonModule, TranslateModule, MatIconModule],
  templateUrl: './chat-message.component.html',
  styleUrl: './chat-message.component.scss',
  changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush, // ⭐ MANDATORY
  host: {
    class: 'flex gap-3 p-4 hover:bg-gray-50', // ⭐ Tailwind classes on host
  },
})
export class ChatMessageComponent {
  // Inputs
  readonly message = input.required<Message>();
  readonly isLast = input<boolean>(false);

  // Outputs
  readonly retry = output<string>();

  // Computed
  readonly isAi = computed(() => this.message().role === 'assistant');

  handleRetry() {
    this.retry.emit(this.message().id);
  }
}
```

### Example: Signal Store (src/app/features/chat/stores/chat.store.ts)

```typescript
import { patchState, signalStore, withMethods, withState } from '@ngrx/signals';
import { Message } from '@types/message.types';
import { inject } from '@angular/core';
import { ChatService } from '../services/chat.service';

type ChatState = {
  messages: Message[];
  isLoading: boolean;
};

const initialState: ChatState = {
  messages: [],
  isLoading: false,
};

export const ChatStore = signalStore(
  { providedIn: 'root' },
  withState(initialState),
  withMethods((store, chatService = inject(ChatService)) => ({
    sendMessage: async (content: string) => {
      patchState(store, { isLoading: true });
      // Logic call API...
      patchState(store, { isLoading: false });
    },
  })),
);
```
